  "content": "<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>動物擴充模組</strong></span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;<span style=\"color:#930\"><a style=\"color:#930\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/animals-plus/pages/change-log\" rel=\"nofollow\">更新</a><a style=\"color:#930\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/animals-plus/pages/change-log\" rel=\"nofollow\">日誌</a></span><span style=\"color:#930\">&nbsp;</span>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<span style=\"color:#0f0\"><a style=\"color:#0f0\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/animals-plus/pages/mobs\" rel=\"nofollow\">生物</a>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/animals-plus/pages/items\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"color:#3cc\"> 物品&nbsp;</span></a>&nbsp;</span>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<span style=\"color:#3cc\"><span style=\"color:#36f\"><a style=\"color:#36f\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/animals-plus/pages/contact\" rel=\"nofollow\">聯絡</a></span><span style=\"color:#00f\"><span style=\"color:#36f\">&nbsp;</span>&nbsp;</span></span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\">&nbsp;</span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>&nbsp;下載</strong></span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>測試版 1.23.05</strong></span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\"><span style=\"color:#00f\"><a href=\"https://legacy.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/animals-plus/download/4753117\" rel=\"nofollow\">1.18.2</a>&nbsp;<a href=\"https://legacy.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/animals-plus/download/4758031\" rel=\"nofollow\">1.18.1</a>&nbsp;<a href=\"https://legacy.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/animals-plus/download/4759010\" rel=\"nofollow\">1.18</a></span></span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\"><strong>舊版本</strong></span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\">&nbsp;<span style=\"color:#00f\"><a style=\"color:#00f\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/animals-plus/download/4362480\" rel=\"nofollow\">1.16.5</a>&nbsp; <a style=\"color:#00f\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/animals-plus/download/4362332\" rel=\"nofollow\">1.15.2</a>&nbsp; <a style=\"color:#00f\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/animals-plus/download/4362426\" rel=\"nofollow\">1.15.1</a></span></span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\">本模組目前新增了18種動物。這些動物會在野外生成，通常成群出現，但並非所有生物都是群體活動，有些會單獨出現。你會遇到被動型和中立型的生物。部分動物會為了領地互相爭鬥，並能捕捉魚類和其他動物。</span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\">擊殺生物後，通常可獲得肉類和皮革。皮革可用來製作衣物、背包及其他少數物品。本模組還新增了彈弓、長矛等武器。收集石頭後，彈弓可用於投擲攻擊。</span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;<img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/414/172/2021-12-11_15.png\" width=\"1113\" height=\"580\"></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/374/268/2021-06-23_12.png\" width=\"1114\" height=\"581\"></p><p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/374/266/2021-06-23_12.png\" width=\"1126\" height=\"587\"></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/398/425/2021-10-02_20.png\" width=\"1126\" height=\"587\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>",
